17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I like stories too! But I also love playing games with friends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I appreciate the depth of literature. It requires patience and focus.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"I'm more of a social butterfly, but I enjoy a mystery novel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us rest now. The night brings its own secrets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
